  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 pound butter, softened",
    "1 (15.25 ounce) can whole kernel corn",
    "1 (15 ounce) can creamed corn",
    "1 (8.5 ounce) package corn bread mix",
    "1 (8 ounce) container sour cream"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C ). Put butter into a 2-quart casserole dish and place into the oven to melt while preheating.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/t0PkOHfT0gqlwfu0zMaV6Z7KK6c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13684-easy-corn-pudding-VAT-step-01-0a34dbbf87264225b1ae9b540d475f82.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13684/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "When butter melts, remove the casserole dish from the oven. Mix both types of corn, cornbread mix, and sour cream into melted butter until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Iqu8dU3f6Y0O4ewG_69xIBxM51I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13684-easy-corn-pudding-VAT-step-02-ef70120dc2414523afb60f7fb60f4d7b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/13684/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for about 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3uN6GAxnNiM8kyRJri91QXmAMUM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/13684-easy-corn-pudding-VAT-step-03-f27a1435a4e74c0893995eae809951d4.jpg"
      ],
